content:
{title: Yesu Obiro Kelo Bura}

{comment: Verse 1}
Yesu obiro kelo bura, Obiro yalo bur ani piny,
Piny ong`eyo bura nogo, Mabiro ni mondo otiek joge.

Chieng` maduogo polo gi pinyni noring wang`e
Kolor e piny jogo mosetho gi jok mangima duto,
Gi biro chung` e nyim jayalo maduong`.

{comment: Verse 2}
Richo okelo bura ne piny, Richo omiyo akuyo,
Omiyojogo  ma nodonji, Epolo gini bed manok

{comment: Verse 3}
Bura biro loyo pinyni, Gi jogo duto mane luwe,
Obiro lalo jaduong` satan emach gi joma luwe.

{comment: Verse 4}
Yesu okelo ngima nono, Obiro miyo jogo moyie,
Obiro riembo joma nyingegi onge, E nyim Nyasaye maler.
